 "title": "最弱的一家",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 101.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "交易所的数据，不只留在交易所里。",
   "spoken": "交易所的数据，不只留在交易所里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.315
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "KYC 服务商、工单系统、邮件营销、物流、破产服务，每一家都是一个泄露点。",
   "spoken": "KYC 服务商、工单系统、邮件营销、物流、破产服务，每一家都是一个泄露点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.7,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 4.793,
   "speechEnd": 12.38
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "2020 年 6 月，攻击者用一把第三方的 API 密钥，进了 Ledger 的电商和营销数据库。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 6 月，攻击者用一把第三方的 API 密钥，进了 Ledger 的电商和营销数据库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 12.76,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 12.76,
   "speechEnd": 20.398
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "约 100 万个邮箱泄露，约 27.2 万条记录带着姓名、住址和电话。",
   "spoken": "约 100 万个邮箱泄露，约 27.2 万条记录带着姓名、住址和电话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 20.82,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 20.82,
   "speechEnd": 26.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "Ledger 后来修正为，约 29.2 万名客户。",
   "spoken": "Ledger 后来修正为，约 29.2 万名客户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 26.8,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 26.8,
   "speechEnd": 30.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "同年 12 月，完整的数据库，被公开在黑客论坛上。",
   "spoken": "同年 12 月，完整的数据库，被公开在黑客论坛上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 30.86,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 30.86,
   "speechEnd": 34.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "之后是大量钓鱼邮件和短信，还有针对客户的威胁电话。",
   "spoken": "之后是大量钓鱼邮件和短信，还有针对客户的威胁电话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 35.4,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 35.4,
   "speechEnd": 40.577
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "硬件钱包本身没有被攻破。",
   "spoken": "硬件钱包本身没有被攻破。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 40.98,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 40.98,
   "speechEnd": 43.086
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "可谁买了硬件钱包，寄到了哪里，本身就是高价值的数据。",
   "spoken": "可谁买了硬件钱包，寄到了哪里，本身就是高价值的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 43.52,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 43.52,
   "speechEnd": 48.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "2023 年 8 月，Kroll 一名员工的手机号，被 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 8 月，Kroll 一名员工的手机号，被 SIM 卡劫持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 48.7,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 48.805,
   "speechEnd": 53.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "攻击者借此看到了 FTX、BlockFi、Genesis 三个破产案的债权人文件。",
   "spoken": "攻击者借此看到了 FTX、BlockFi、Genesis 三个破产案的债权人文件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 53.88,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 53.972,
   "speechEnd": 60.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "姓名、地址、邮箱，还有账户余额。",
   "spoken": "姓名、地址、邮箱，还有账户余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 60.82,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 60.82,
   "speechEnd": 63.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "外包商员工的手机号，也成了你的攻击面。",
   "spoken": "外包商员工的手机号，也成了你的攻击面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 64.32,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 64.32,
   "speechEnd": 67.098
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2024 年 1 月，Trezor 的第三方工单平台，遭到未授权访问。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 1 月，Trezor 的第三方工单平台，遭到未授权访问。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 67.58,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 67.687,
   "speechEnd": 72.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "最多约 6.6 万名联系过客服的用户，邮箱和姓名泄露。",
   "spoken": "最多约 6.6 万名联系过客服的用户，邮箱和姓名泄露。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 73.08,
